{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Car Parking Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Step into the driver\u2019s seat and test your precision! Real Car Parking Simulator focuses on what matters the most!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f Big opened city with many places to park in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 Different models of cars to choose from!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 Challenging parking spots where you have to avoid obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae You can look at the car from many points of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Become the master of parking and complete all of the levels!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about racing \u2013 it\u2019s about precision. Show that you\u2019ve got the focus, patience, and skill to become a true parking master!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066650?t=1760734427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/9e04e40c75719b6a66ba63a893ce9b9b31c45430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760734427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/54af0362a44f224138803db42416ec41d7015abb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760734427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/54af0362a44f224138803db42416ec41d7015abb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760734427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Tim